<title>SOUTH KOREA: LOTTE CHILSUNG H1 NET SURGES.</title>
<headline>LOTTE CHILSUNG H1 NET SURGES.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					     5.47 vs    0.95</p>
<p>    Turnover				    349.12 vs  321.55</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   8.35 vs    0.99</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries			loss 0.17 vs    none</p>
<p>Note - Lotte Chilsung Beverage Co Ltd is South Korea's largest non-alcoholic beverage maker. Earnings jumped on strong sales growth and reduced production costs, a company official said.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
